        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worlds: The Great Odyssey</strong> is in the early stages of development. By purchasing now, you’re supporting our journey to complete the full game while gaining <strong>exclusive early access</strong> to explore content as it’s created.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You Get Right Now</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to the first playable build of <i>Worlds: The Great Odyssey</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting gear package:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tesseract Energy Core</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Muramusa</strong> (sidearm with damage bonus)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascalon</strong> (assault rifle)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balmung</strong> (shotgun)</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work in Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll encounter <strong>incomplete enemies, NPCs, and worlds</strong> as development continues. These are playable, but not yet in their final form.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; NPCs in development</strong>: Gryphon, Wendigo, Ammit, Minotaur, Mary, The Stranger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worlds in development</strong>: Armozel, Eleleth, Oriel, Daveithai, Sophia, Ark Malachi</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ongoing Updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular content updates will expand and refine the game. Each new update introduces fresh worlds, enemies, and story elements as we build toward the complete Odyssey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Early Access?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support allows us to keep creating and improving this universe. As development progresses, the game will grow significantly in scope and price. Buying now secures your place in the journey at the lowest price.<br><br><br><br><i><strong>__________________________________________________________________________</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong>WORLDS: The Great Odyssey</strong></i> is a 2D top-down sci-fi action RPG where swordplay meets ranged weapon combat in a vast, alien universe. Journey across hand-crafted worlds inspired by myth and mystery, each with its own creatures, challenges, bosses and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2230, Earth is dying. A last exodus — the Ark Project — sends humanity into the stars in search of new worlds. But something went terribly wrong. The great immigration fleet is shattered, and you awake alone on a hostile alien world, your mission in ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Maya and your adventure begins following the mysterious calamity that struck the ark fleet. As you explore, battle, and uncover the truth, you’ll forge your own path through an odyssey that will challenge your understanding of reality. Across seven hand-crafted worlds, you will battle strange and primal lifeforms, encounter fellow survivors, and meet mysterious allies and enemies who hold pieces of the truth. Each victory brings you closer to a deeper, more ancient story — one that merges Earth’s hidden history with cosmic war, esoteric wisdom, and powers that reach beyond time.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> – Blend melee sword strikes with ranged weapons for fast-paced encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Alien Worlds</strong> – Each biome is richly detailed and filled with unique creatures, NPCs, and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Discovery</strong> – Secrets, hidden areas, and environmental puzzles reward curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Art &amp; Animation</strong> – High-resolution 2D visuals and atmospheric effects bring each world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich Adventure</strong> – Uncover the truth behind the Great Odyssey through dialogue, lore, and epic encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong> – Face powerful foes that test skill, timing, and strategy.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worlds: The Great Odyssey</strong> is in the early stages of development. By purchasing now, you’re supporting our journey to complete the full game while gaining <strong>exclusive early access</strong> to explore content as it’s created.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You Get Right Now</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to the first playable build of <i>Worlds: The Great Odyssey</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting gear package:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tesseract Energy Core</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Muramusa</strong> (sidearm with damage bonus)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascalon</strong> (assault rifle)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balmung</strong> (shotgun)</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work in Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll encounter <strong>incomplete enemies, NPCs, and worlds</strong> as development continues. These are playable, but not yet in their final form.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; NPCs in development</strong>: Gryphon, Wendigo, Ammit, Minotaur, Mary, The Stranger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worlds in development</strong>: Armozel, Eleleth, Oriel, Daveithai, Sophia, Ark Malachi</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ongoing Updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular content updates will expand and refine the game. Each new update introduces fresh worlds, enemies, and story elements as we build toward the complete Odyssey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Early Access?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support allows us to keep creating and improving this universe. As development progresses, the game will grow significantly in scope and price. Buying now secures your place in the journey at the lowest price.<br><br><br><br><i><strong>__________________________________________________________________________</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong>WORLDS: The Great Odyssey</strong></i> is a 2D top-down sci-fi action RPG where swordplay meets ranged weapon combat in a vast, alien universe. Journey across hand-crafted worlds inspired by myth and mystery, each with its own creatures, challenges, bosses and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2230, Earth is dying. A last exodus — the Ark Project — sends humanity into the stars in search of new worlds. But something went terribly wrong. The great immigration fleet is shattered, and you awake alone on a hostile alien world, your mission in ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Maya and your adventure begins following the mysterious calamity that struck the ark fleet. As you explore, battle, and uncover the truth, you’ll forge your own path through an odyssey that will challenge your understanding of reality. Across seven hand-crafted worlds, you will battle strange and primal lifeforms, encounter fellow survivors, and meet mysterious allies and enemies who hold pieces of the truth. Each victory brings you closer to a deeper, more ancient story — one that merges Earth’s hidden history with cosmic war, esoteric wisdom, and powers that reach beyond time.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> – Blend melee sword strikes with ranged weapons for fast-paced encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Alien Worlds</strong> – Each biome is richly detailed and filled with unique creatures, NPCs, and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Discovery</strong> – Secrets, hidden areas, and environmental puzzles reward curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Art &amp; Animation</strong> – High-resolution 2D visuals and atmospheric effects bring each world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich Adventure</strong> – Uncover the truth behind the Great Odyssey through dialogue, lore, and epic encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong> – Face powerful foes that test skill, timing, and strategy.</p></li></ul>",
